    "hobbies": "bouldering: I love to rock climb because its both a physical and mental challenge. finding out ways to climb a rock while also having the strength to do it is something i find so much joy in. It helps me to overcome my fear of heights as well as test my limits. I also love to celebrate after finishing a hard climb! gym: going to the gym has been a big part of my life. I've been going for around 3 ish years and it has changed my life for the better since i have been overweight most of my life. Seeing the progress and how far i've come is so incredibly satisfying that it makes me want to push myself harder. anime: i love watching any type of anime but mostly mystery/romance ones. Ive started watching in 2020 (quarantine) and I still occasionally watch. this is one of my favorite ways to pass the time and I love using this as a way to connect with friends who also watch as I can share recommendations or even take them! my favorite is freiren! music: since I watched a lot of anime I really love the J-pop genre. My favorite artist is YOASOBI and noa. But outside of jpop i really love rnb music. I really like to listen to keshi, the weeknd, sza, ariana grande, and more! I do listen to pretty much anything though. Music is always playing 24/7 especially when I study. I love listening to lofi or just background music from the animes I watch. video games: I love to play horror games and sometimes valorant. Roblox horror games are my favorite and I love playing them with friends! I do like the five nights at freddy's series though and I love watching other people play horror games aswell. As for valorant I am silver and don't play too often but I'd love to play with friends. travelling: I love to go on spontaneous trips whether it be around the bay or even globally. Well for global trips it definitely isn't spontaneous. If im asked to go to a spot like valleyfair i'll be there in 20!! I love to plan trips with my friends though. I'm usually the group planner for both my friends and family as I've planned 2 japan trips in the past few years! sports: i've played volleyball in highschool for 3 years and I am taking volleyball classes right now! I play as a libero because I am too short to play any other position :( but i love it. i love volleyball because it is so team centered. I love working and playing with other's as you have people you trust and can lean on! fashion: I just started getting into fashion but i really love baggy clothes!!! I want to collect more pieces and become more stylish in the futuree. it helps express my creativity and i just love wearing nice clothes. photography: although I am not a professional photographer I am my friend groups' main photographer. I love composition and capturing emotions in a picture. I feel like each and every picture tells a story which brings me so much joy when my friends love the pictures I take for them. I also love it when my friends take pictures for me! BEACH: i love going to the beach and watching sunsets/sunrise. Ive gone a few times and I've loved it every time. it gives a perfect amount of time to bond with whoever you're with and just feels surreal. skincare: i've been using skincare for the past 2 ish years and it has helped me build a self care routine for myself! i start with roundlab's dokdo toner, then purito's bamboo panthenol cream and ending it with roundlab's birch sunscreen.",
    "music": "JPOP - harenohi (ushio reira) - 1000 days of moments (noa) - tracing a dream (YOASOBI) krnb - lily of the valley (DANIEL) - night train (milena) - like a dream (MINNIE) kpop - CRAZY (lesserafim) - GO! - (cortis) - midas touch (kiss of life) RNB - die trying (partynextdoor drake) - sugar talking (sabrina carpenter) - soft spot (keshi)",
    "movies": "shows - freiren beyond journey's end - hunter x hunter - fruits baskets - blue box - the fragrant flowers bloom with dignity - lovely runner - squid game movies - kpop demon hunters - demon slayer - gonjiam haunted asylum - incantation - train to busan - your e",
    "perfectDay": "A perfect day for me would be going to the gym in the morning around 10 ish am. After working out I'd head home and shower to go out once again to get food with a friend or alone. I'd love to head to the mall to go shopping to find better clothes. After shopping I'd get a sweet treat such as boba or ice cream and then I'd go rock climbing. Aroudn this time It'd be 6 ish pm. I'd then drive home and then wind down by watching anime or playing video games!",
