    "hobbies": "In my free time, I like going to the gym and specifically enjoy going on runs, weightlifting, and calisthenics. Going on runs helps me clear my mind and let me think and debrief about any situations that are hard to handle at the moment. Overall, going to the gym helps me clear my mind and get a good sweat in. I also enjoy combat sports such as Wrestling and Brazilian Jiu-Jitsu. I grew up doing Japanese karate called \"Kenpo\" so practicing that every now and again is also something I enjoy. These contact sport help me blow off steam and like going to the gym, it is can outlet for me to get rid of any feelings I'm harboring. Most of all I grew up around martial arts and it became part of my life for a good amount of time and keeping up with it is a was to still be in touch with myself while getting a full body workout in. Aside from being active, I enjoy playing musical instruments. Since the third grade of been playing guitar and I started off playing Rock music in a band, but slowly branched out to Christian music since I'm Christian. In my free time however, I play the Blues since it has no \"form\" and can be played in multiple ways as there is no set way to play this genre. It's fun and also a good emotional outlet that I've found useful. I've been going to the gym for three years, playing guitar for ten, and have been involved in multiple martial arts for twelve years. Not only are these activities and hobbies for me, but they make up who I am today and I intend to do my future self a favor by keeping up with these hobbies for the rest of my life.",
    "music": "My favorite genre of music is Hip-Hop such as \"MAMA JAMMA\" by Nuevo Lio and Endoh, \"I'M ON ONE\" by Future and Drake, and \"1st Off\" by DB.BoutaBag. I also enjoy RnB like \"DON'T LEAVE\" by GIVEON, \"Focus\" by H.E.R., and \"Candy Rain\" by Soul For Real. Filipino music is something I enjoy as well and some songs consist of \"Makasarili Malambing\" by Kristina Dawn and Hev Abi and \"Harana\" by Parokya Ni Edgar. Lastly, I enjoy Islander songs like \"Utu Bang Bang\" by Ka'ikena Scalan and \"Love Me\" by Fia.",
    "movies": "My favorite shows consist of anime like Demon Slayer, Dragon Ball, and Hajime no Ippo, Initial D. I also like K-Dramas like My Demon, Bloodhounds, and Hierarchy. Some movies that I've found myself rewatching over and over again would be the Creed franchise, \"The Accountant\" franchise, as well as the \"\"Fast and Furious\" franchise.",
    "perfectDay": "In a day without responsibilities, I would start off by going on a run, doing calisthenics, and weightlifting. After that, I'd hang out with my friends or girlfriend in which I would like to go to brunch, go thrifting, going to candy stores, and end the afternoon off with opening up blind boxes. To start the night off, I'd like to do some bag work on the punching bag that I would have in my apartment gym just to sweat and burn calories that I've gained throughout the day. I would then take my take getting ready for bed and use that time to wind down. I would then sleep after and hopefully have my dog sleeping my bed with me.",
