    "hobbies": "hi ace commitee (i copy and pasted a lot of everything this from my ak ading form teehee, i have 19 units this semester im cooked) Thrifting/Fashion - LOVE LOVE LOVE THRIFTING AND UPCYCLING, I have bags of clothes I’ve hella been meaning to alter to resell or wear depends LOL but I literally just broke my sewing machine so I keep buying clothes. I’ll get a new machine when I have the money trust. I also love fashion, would I call myself performative? Mayhaps. Depends. Lwky I dress like a brandy girl in the summer, winter though I dress like a fashion mf or a vintage y2k girly. I wanna get into getting jewlery but like I hella hate like having to take it all off n what not but anything for the fit frfr. DIY Projects - DIY girl to a tee. Need something made, I got you. Never made it before, I will attempt no balls. Like I’d love to learn a new skill if you are in need of an item. The amount of promprosals and hoco proposals I’ve helped with is crazy, I also did leadership in highschool so like a big part of doing DIY stemmed from that. I ALSO shameless plug do my own nails and pressons. Lwky I pick things up and like surprisingly I always am good at it :] which is always funny to me cause for academics I be struggling like crazy sometimes Working/Collecting - Ugh I love working, well no. I like making money. UNFORTUNATELY if you i do get picked up i’m a very low maintenance little because I lit pride myself on making money so I’m usually working. Ive been working nonstop since I was 15 ive had like 7 jobs in the span of 2.5 years maybe with like 1 or 2 month breaks. Um as much as I work I spend so much money I fear for my future I have maybe like less than 1k saved up ermmm, but alongside working comes my love for spending and collecting things hehe. Recently I haven’t been buying as many blindboxes cause im trying to save for an Ipad but I collect smiskis (I have like a whole bowl of them) and recently I saw like this pucky egg thing from popmart I really want them. Other than that i like to have miscellaneous things like pokemon cards, chikawa plushes, or anything cute from time to time I collect. Cooking & Baking - Teehee love to bake, learning to cook kinda. More like learning to cook more complex things. Yah not much abt that. Also Its my major and I work at a bakery so I basically live and breathe food. Photography/Social Media - I love to take pictures of everything and anything but myself haha. During high school I did photography for most if not all events and made videos hehe I even worked my own prom, kinda sad but it was boring anyways. I have 2 digis a Sony T99 I use for flash/night photos and a Kodak PixPro FZ45 that I just got for more detailed dual pics. I don’t really post myself on social media but I do post a lot of photos I take. I really would love to take photos of myself and post but it just feels so awkward and I've never been comfortable in my own skin growing up. Like every group photo I always offer to take the photo and not be in it. I really thank my VSA big though she forces me to take pics with her for memories even though I never post. Raving/Concerts - LOVE LOVE LOVE concerts lit cannot live w/o seeing some people live. My fav concerts I’ve been to were def BEA in sf last yr(splurged on vip had the best time on rails), Malcolm Todd Rockstar Tour(did a meet n greet w him, hes so sweet teehee), and Joji’s Pandemonium Tour like in 2022(also at rails) which was my first, also that was my intro to like raving/clubbing (his opener was kenny beats who also happens to be playing at niteharts this year woohoo) which I didnt know till now hahahah. Getting into raving also, it’s not like crazy enjoyable but I do it w my BF so I think it’s all chill. As long as the musics bumpin and the vibes are up im all for it. Also I tend to cry at concerts and raves, LMFAO idk it js happens then it stops. Lit im not sad im js an empath and like sometimes the experience is so life changing u gotta shed a tear am i right or am i right!!",
